Alternative to archive.phText-only, no Javascript(Seeking Alpha)   curl https://assets.msn.com/content/view/v2/Detail/en-in/AA2880s6 \
   |sed '
    s/.*\"body\":\"/<meta charset=utf-8>/;
    s/\",\"readTime.*//;
    s/?utm_source.\{53\}//g;
    s/&source=more_on//g;
   ' \
   |tr -d '\134' > 1.htm
   firefox ./1.htm

